cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to Fanficly, please cite it using these details."
type: software
title: "Fanficly: an AO3 reader app for iPhone, iPad, Mac and Windows"
abstract: >-
  Fanficly is a free, ad-free app for reading fanfiction from Archive of Our
  Own (AO3) on iPhone, iPhone Duo, iPad, Mac and Windows. It searches AO3 with
  live tag suggestions and every AO3 filter, keeps a library that works
  offline, remembers your place to the paragraph, and reads stories aloud with
  on-device voices. It has no Fanficly servers or accounts, no ads and no
  analytics. It is not affiliated with AO3 or the Organization for
  Transformative Works.
authors:
